{"features":[{"feature_idx":0,"name":"en","type":{"dtype":"string","_type":"Value"}},{"feature_idx":1,"name":"wo","type":{"dtype":"string","_type":"Value"}},{"feature_idx":2,"name":"non_standardized","type":{"dtype":"string","_type":"Value"}}],"rows":[{"row_idx":0,"row":{"en":"Constance: My cat, Sangeetha, is always there to greet me at the door when I come home from work.","wo":"Constance: Sama muus, Sangeetha daf may buyu saa yu ma wàccee liggéey ba yegsi ci kër gi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nConstance: Sama mousse, Sangeetha dafmaye buyou sa youma wathiey ligueye ba yegsi thi keur gui.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1,"row":{"en":"[The people continue to chant.]","wo":"[Nit ñi wéy di way.]","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nNit gni way di wayé\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2,"row":{"en":"Joseph: Oh no, Jasmine.","wo":"Joseph: Déet waay, Jasmine.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nJoseph: Déet waye Jasmine\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3,"row":{"en":"You'll feel refreshed and rejuvenated, ready to take on the day.","wo":"Beesaat naa tàkk boole dellu ndaw, mën naa tàmbali sama bis.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBessate na takk bolé dellou ndaw, meun na tambali sama biss.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":4,"row":{"en":"But for every person who found success in the city, there were many more who struggled to make ends meet.","wo":"Waaye su amee kenn ku tekki ci dëkk, amna ñeneen ñu bari ñuy sonn lool balaa ñuy mëna faj seen soxla.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nWayé sou amé kene kou tekki si deuk amna gnénéne gnou bari gnoy sonal lolou bala gnoy meuna fadial sen sokhla.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":5,"row":{"en":"She had been with many men, but none of them had ever been able to give her the kind of pleasure that she craved.","wo":"Yàgg na nekk ak góor ñu bari waaye kenn ci ñoom musu ko mëna jox xeetu bànneex bimu yàgg a wër.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nYagg na nekk ak goor gnou bari wayé kene thi gnom meusou ko meuna diokh khettou baneekh bimou yagg a weur.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":6,"row":{"en":"When Muhammad was first called to be a prophet, he was very afraid.","wo":"Bi ñu njëkkee wax Muhamed niko dangay nekk yonent, dafa ànd ak tiitaange.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBi gnou ndieukeu wakh Mouhamed niko dangaye nekk yonent, dafa ande ak tiitangé.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":7,"row":{"en":"What is the meaning of becoming a queen? asked the young woman.","wo":"Jigéen ju ndaw ji daal di koy laaj, Nekk ab reine lan lay wundu?","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDjiguéne djou ndaw dji daldi koy ladj, nekk ab reine lane lay woundou ?\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":8,"row":{"en":"The music of the hippie movement was diverse, but it was often characterized by its experimental nature and its focus on spirituality and social change.","wo":"Music yu fenomen hippie bari woon nañu te wuute, waaye li ci doon gëna fës mooy li mbir la mu ñu doon sooga door, ba noppi lalu ngëm ak bëgga soppi askan wi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMusic you fenomen hippie bari wone nagnou té wouté wayé li thi done geuna feuss moy li mbir leu mou gnou done soga door ba nopi lalou ngeum ak beuga sopi askane wi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":9,"row":{"en":"She's a great example of what happens when you stand up for yourself and refuse to put up with a bad situation.","wo":"Moom misaal la buy jàngale li nit ki mëna am su amee fulla ci boppam di baña nangu ku koy noot.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMome misal la bouy diangalé li nitt ki meuna ame sou amé foulla thi boppam di bagna nangou kou koy note.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":10,"row":{"en":"Suddenly, all that grace and efficiency is lost, and the bike becomes a clumsy, awkward intruder.","wo":"Ci saasi taar ba nga gisoon ci moom yéppay réer, mu dem ba mujj nekk li lay xatal.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nCi sassi taar ba nga guissone ci mom yeupay rér mou dem ba moudj neuk li lay hatal.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":11,"row":{"en":"The soap opera centers around the lives of the residents of a small town.","wo":"Fëyëtoŋ bi dafay nettali dundug ñiy yewwoo ci benn dëkk bu ndaw.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nFeuyeuton bi dafay netali doundoug gniiy yewouwo thi bene deuk bou ndaw.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":12,"row":{"en":"Hospitals are an important part of the healthcare system.","wo":"Hopitaal yi lu am solo lañu ci wàllu xeet jàngoro.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nHopital yi lou am solo lagnou si wallou khétt diangoro.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":13,"row":{"en":"As we started to hike back down, we realized that the view was even better from below.","wo":"Bi nuy tàmbali wàcci, nu gis ni xool bi ci suuf la gëna rafetee sax.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBi gnuy tambali wathie, niou guiss ni khol bi thi souf la geuna rafété sakh.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":14,"row":{"en":"Infections are caused by bacteria, viruses, or fungi.","wo":"Bakteri yi, virus yi wala champignon yi ñooy waral infektioŋ yi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBakteri yi virus yi wala champignon yi gnoy waral infection yi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":15,"row":{"en":"She's become really irritable and short-tempered.","wo":"Dafa naqari deret lool te du muñ dara.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDafa nakharé derét loool té dou mouniou dara.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":16,"row":{"en":"I grew up in a small village in the middle of nowhere.","wo":"Maa ngi juddoo ci dëkk bu ndaw bu sori lool.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMaa ngui djouddo ci deuk bou ndaw bou sori loool.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":17,"row":{"en":"But power is not a thing to be used for your own gain.","wo":"Waaye kàttan du looy jëfandikoo ci say mbiri bopp kese.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nWayé khattan dou loy dieufandiko si say mbirri bopp kessé.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":18,"row":{"en":"I’m asking you to apologize because it’s the right thing to do.","wo":"Dama bëgg nga jéggalu ndax mooy li nga wara def.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDama beugua dieggalou ndakh moy li gua wara def.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":19,"row":{"en":"The recent rise of social media has given rise to a new breed of celebrities: the social media influencer.","wo":"Juggug reso sosio yi ci jamono yii moo jur xeetu nit ñu siiw ñu leen di woowe: influensëru reso sosio.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDjuggou resso sosio yi thi diamono yii mo djure khettou nitt gnou siiw gnou len di wowé influenceurou resso sosio.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":20,"row":{"en":"He was always micromanaging everyone, and he was quick to criticize.","wo":"Foo ko fekk mungi lijjanti ku nekk, te daa gaawa sikkal nit.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nFoo ko fekk moungui lidieunti kou nek, té daa gaawa sikal nitt.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":21,"row":{"en":"An important part of my identity is my indigenous heritage, and our connection with birds like the crow and raven.","wo":"Bokk na ci li ëpp solo ci liy màndargaal ki ma doon, mooy sama ndono indigene ak sunu lëkkaloo ak picci korney ak korbóo.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBokk na si li eup solo si liy mandargal ki ma done moy sama ndono indigene ak souniou leukalo ak picci korné ak korboo.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":22,"row":{"en":"This trend is being driven by a number of factors, including the increasing awareness of the benefits of self-care, the growing popularity of men's grooming products, and the rise of social media, which has made it more acceptable for men to talk about their beauty routines.","wo":"Barina lu waral gaa yi jël ko ak doole, lu ci melni kàmpaañ yi ñuy amal ngir yee nit ñi ci njariñu toppatoo sa bopp, bariwaayu produit yu góor di toppatoo yaramam, ak reso sosio yu bari yi, tax leegi nit tàmbali di nangu xool góor ñiy wax ni ñuy toppatoo seen yaram bis bu nekk.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBarina lou waral gars yi dieul ko ak dolé, lou ci melni kampagn yi gnuy amal nguir yé nitt gni si ndiarignou topato sa bopp, bariwayou produit you goor di topato yaramam, ak réseau sosio you bari yi, takh légui nitt tambali di nangou khol goor gnuy wakh ni gnuy topato sen yaram biss bou nekk.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":23,"row":{"en":"My mom explained that rabbits need to eat fiber in order to digest their food properly.","wo":"Sama yaay xamal ma ni lëk yi dañu soxla lekk fibre ngir reesal bu baax liñu lekk.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSama yay khamal ma ni leuk yi daniou sokhla lekk fibre nguir résal bou bakh lignou lekk.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":24,"row":{"en":"The lyrics were explicit and violent, and he didn't want his daughter exposed to that kind of material.","wo":"Kàdduy way wi dañu ànd ak fitna te bëggul woon kàddu yu ñaaw yooyu di lor dooma.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKadouy way wi daniou and ak fitna té beugoul wone kadou you niaw yoyou di lor doma.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":25,"row":{"en":"Gradually, the ladder begins to reverse direction and then falls, crushing dozens underneath.","wo":"Ndank-ndank, seel bi tambalina demee ca wallaa ba jekki daanu, daadi gaañ lu mott ay fukki-fukki nit ci ronn.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nNdank ndank, seel bi tambalina démé ca walla ba djekki danou, dadi gagn lou mott ay fouki fouki nitt thi ronn.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":26,"row":{"en":"Then she went back to the man and gave him the match and the rose.","wo":"Mu dellu ci ku góor ki daal di koy jox alumet gi ak rose bi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMou dellou si kou goor ki daldi koy diokh alumet dji ak rose bi\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":27,"row":{"en":"Redeem yourself and tell me what that beam of light really was!","wo":"Dekkil te nga wax ma bii limyéer lu mu doonoon!","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDeukil té nga wakh ma bii limier loumou donone !\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":28,"row":{"en":"They waited until the after-party, and then they cut the cake and served it to everyone.","wo":"Ñu daal di xaar ba feet bi jeex, ñu daal di dagg gato bi daal di ko séddale ñépp.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nGnou daal di khar ba fete bi diékh, gnou daal di dague gato bi daal di ko sedalé nieup.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":29,"row":{"en":"* 1 cup all-purpose flour","wo":"* 1 kaasu farine bu mën dem fépp","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\n1 kassou farine bou meun dem feppé\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":30,"row":{"en":"Memes often use familiar images or phrases, and they can be used to express a wide range of emotions.","wo":"Meme yi dañuy faral di jëfandikoo nataal wala mbind yuñ miin, te mën nañu leen jëfandikoo ngir fësal yëg-yëg yu bari.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMeme yi daniouy faral di dieufandiko nataal wala mbind yougnou miine té meune nagnou léne dieufandiko nguir feusal yeug yeug you bari.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":31,"row":{"en":"She was tall and slender, with long black hair and dark eyes.","wo":"Mingi njool, sew am kawar gu gudd te ñuul ak bët yu ñuul.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMoungui ndiol sew am kawar gou goud té gnioul ak beet you gnioul\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":32,"row":{"en":"hazard","wo":"lu nu mën a tànn","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nlou gnou meun a tann ?\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":33,"row":{"en":"She was angry that she had been made to feel ashamed of herself, and she was angry that she had been denied her right to love.","wo":"Dafa meroon ndax dañu fexe bamu rus ci boppam, leneen liko merloo mooy dañu ko xañoon yelleefam ci mbëggeel.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDafa meroone ndakh daniou fekhé bamou russe thi boppam, lénéne liko merlo moy daniou ko khagnone yellefam thi mbeuguel.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":34,"row":{"en":"Gene expression profiling revealed a pronounced pro-inflammatory phenotype.","wo":"Profilaasu exprseioŋ genetik bi dafa wane ab fonetip imflamatoir bu saf.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nProfilassou expression genetik bi dafa wané ab phonetip inflamatoir bou saf.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":35,"row":{"en":"Let us reject, break and bind the forces that seek to control and pervert our destiny.","wo":"Nanu dàq, bañ ñenn di nu jéema wax funu wara jaar ba noppi di yàq sunu ëlëg.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nNagnou dak, bagn gnen di gnou djéma wakh fougnou wara diar ba noppi di yak sounou eleuk.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":36,"row":{"en":"I'm really excited about it B: Me too.","wo":"Loolu luma neex la B: Man itam.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLolou louma nékh la B mane itame\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":37,"row":{"en":"Injuries can also cause inflammation.","wo":"Gaañ-gaañu mën na indi inflamasioŋ itam.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nGaan-gaanu meun na indi inflammation itame.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":38,"row":{"en":"A seed is a small, dormant plant embryo that is capable of developing into a new plant under the right conditions.","wo":"Jiwwu mooy benn pepp bu ndaw, gàñcax guy nelaw bu mëna jebbi nekk gàñcax gu ndaw su nekke ci anam yi war.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nJiwwou moy bene pepp bou ndaw, ganthiah guy nelaw bou meuna diebbi nekk ganthiah gou ndaw sou nekke thi anam yi war.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":39,"row":{"en":"Sometimes, all you need is a little encouragement to get you started.","wo":"Yenn saa, li ngay soxla du lenn ludul kula ñaax nga tàmbali.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nYenn saa li ngay sokhla dou lenn loudoul koula gnakh nga tambali.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":40,"row":{"en":"It is a testament to the power of life and the resilience of the natural world.","wo":"Loolu dafay firndeel dooley dundu ba noppi di jàppale liy dundu ci kaw suuf.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLoolou dafay firndél dooléy doundou ba noppi di diapalé liy doundou thi kaw souf.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":41,"row":{"en":"Other people feel a need to bully, manipulate, shout, and push their perspectives upon one another.","wo":"Ñeneen ñi deñuy soxla di waññiwaate, di jaay xel, di yuuxu ak di jaay doole ngir weyal seeni xalaat ci sen digante.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nGnénén gni deugnou sokhla di wagnniwaté di djay khel di youkhou ak di djay dolé nguir weuyal séni khalat thi sén diganté.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":42,"row":{"en":"Your mother loves you, and she deserves your respect.","wo":"Sa yaay dafla bëgg, te danga ko wara jox cër.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSa yay dafla beugg té danga ko wara diokh thieur.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":43,"row":{"en":"A few days later, I received a letter in the mail informing me that I had passed the written test.","wo":"Biñu demee fan yu néew, ma jot bataaxal mu may yëgal ni jàll naa examen bind bi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBignou démé fane you néw, ma diot bataxal mou may yégal ni djal nà examen bind bi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":44,"row":{"en":"If you have any spills on your cork flooring, it is important to clean them up as soon as possible.","wo":"Su amee lu tuuru ci dëru liege, li gën mooy nga fomp ko ci nimu gëna gaawe.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSou amé lou tourou thi deuru liege li gueune moy nga fomp ko thi nimou geuna gaawé\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":45,"row":{"en":"One day, the beggar told Amara that it was time for her to demonstrate her skills.","wo":"Benn bis, yalwaankat bi ni Amara leegi nak jotna nga wane linga mëna.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBene biss yalwaankate bi ni Amara légui nak diotna nga wané linga meuna.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":46,"row":{"en":"I also like to spend time with my family.","wo":"Dinaa toog itam ak sunu waa kër.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDina togue itame ak souniou wa keur.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":47,"row":{"en":"Some of them were quite old, dating back to the early 1900s.","wo":"Yenn ci rëset yi dañu yàgg, maase ak jamonoy 1900.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nYenn thi ruset yi daniou yague massé ak diamonoy 1900.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":48,"row":{"en":"One study, which was published in the journal JAMA Psychiatry, found that patients who received personalized therapy based on their data were more likely to improve their symptoms than those who received standard therapy.","wo":"Benn jàngat, buñu siiwal ci surnaalu JAMA Psychiatry, dafa wane ni malaad yi am paj muñ personaalise bu sukkandiko ci seeni done ñoo gëna gaawa tane ñeneen ñiy jël xeetu paj mi ñuy faral di def.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBenn diangat bouniou siwal thi sournalou JAMA Psychiatry dafa wané ni malaad yi ame patch mouniou personnalise bou soukandiko thi séni done nio gueuna gaawa tané gnénéne gnii dieul kheutou patch mii gniouy faral di def.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":49,"row":{"en":"They might think that you're lazy or unkempt.","wo":"Mën nañu jàpp ni danga tàyyeel wala sa léppa jaxasoo.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMeun nagnou diap ni da nga tayyeul wala sa lépé diakhasso.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":50,"row":{"en":"When you're ready to check out, our service will automatically find the best deals for you and apply them to your order.","wo":"Soo demee bay fay, sunu serwiis dalay xoolal ci saasi li gëna xéewale suko defee nga boole ko ci sa komànd.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSo démé baye fay sounou serwiis dalay kholal thi sassi li geuna khéwalé souko défé nga booléko si sa komandé.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":51,"row":{"en":"Add flavorings, transfer to a glass jar and let it sit in the fridge for a couple days to get real yummy.","wo":"Dolli ci say cafka, nga sotti ko ci potu weer bàyyi ko mu sedd ci frigo bi ñaari fan, lu bari ngay am.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDolli si say cafeka, nga sotti ko si potou weer bayyi ko mou sedj si frigo bi gnari fane, lou bari ngay ame.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":52,"row":{"en":"To use them well is to understand the language of cooking, to season the dish with the flavors of experience and skill.","wo":"Xam ni ñu leen di jëfandikoo mooy dégg làkku togg, xam nu ñuy safalee togg ak cafka yuy wane ku xam ak mën togg.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKhamni gnou len di dieufandiko moy degg lakou togue, kham nou gnuy safalé togue ak cafka youy wané kou kham ak meun togue.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":53,"row":{"en":"Plastic bags are made from a type of plastic called polyethylene, which is derived from fossil fuels.","wo":"Sac plastik yi ñu ngi leen di defaree plastik bu ñuy woowe polyethylene biy jogee ci kombustible fosil yi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSac plastik yi gnoungui lén di defaré plastik bougnouy wowé polyéthylène biy djogué ci combustible fossiles yi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":54,"row":{"en":"It is expressed through acts of kindness, compassion, and forgiveness.","wo":"Dañu koy wane ci mbaax, ci yërmaande ak ci njéggal.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDagnou koy wané thi mbakh, thi yeureumandé ak thi ndieugal.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":55,"row":{"en":"I mean, I'm a good guy. I don't sell liquor to minors.","wo":"Manaam, man lu jaadu rek laay def, duma jaay xale sàngara.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nManaam mane lou diadou rek lay def douma djay khalé sangara.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":56,"row":{"en":"He was tall and thin, with a long beard and a kind face. Are you a paleontologist? the boy asked.","wo":"Dafa jool ba noppi sew, mingi yor sikkim bu gudd. Xale bi laaj ko, xanaa paleontologist nga?","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDafa djool ba nopi sew, moungui yorr sikkim bou goud. Khalé bi ladj ko khana paleontologue nga?\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":57,"row":{"en":"Kevin: I've been thinking about starting a new business.","wo":"Kevin: Sama xel yépp a ngi ci tàmbali liggéey bu bees.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKevin: Sama hel yeup a ngui thi tambali liguey bou bess.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":58,"row":{"en":"However, there are many conservation efforts underway to protect these amazing animals.","wo":"Waaye amna ay sàrt yu bari yuñ tëral ngir aar rab yu yéeme yooyu.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nWayé amna ay sart you bari yougn teural nguir aar rab you yémé yoyou.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":59,"row":{"en":"As he walked, he noticed a stray dog following him.","wo":"Mu dox ba ci yàgg gis xaj bu réer di ko topp.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMou dokh ba thi yagg guiss khadj bou réér diko top.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":60,"row":{"en":"The man was wearing a long white coat and had a strange device in his hand.","wo":"Ku góor ki mingi sol màntoo bu weex ba noppi yor benn aparey ci loxoom.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKou goor ki moungui sol mantou bou wekh ba noppi yorr bene apareille si lokhoom.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":61,"row":{"en":"4. Place the pork belly in a roasting tin and roast in the oven for 2 hours, or until the skin is golden brown and the meat is cooked through.","wo":"4. Dugalal dënnu mbaam mi ci plaatu toggukaay ba noppi nga dugal ko ci fuur bi 2 waxtu, wala ba der doore boole ci yàpp wi ñor bu baax.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDougalal deunou mbam mi si platu togoukay ba nopi nga dougal ko si four bi 2 waxtou, wala ba der dooré boolé si yap wi nior bou bakh.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":62,"row":{"en":"The entire castle of every Disney movie has featured a logo in the shape of an 's'!","wo":"Bépp chateau ci filmu Disney yi dañu leen tabax ñu am logo bu am formu s!","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBeupp chateau ci filmou disney yi daniou len tabakh niou ame logo bou ame formou s!\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":63,"row":{"en":"This perseverance is given to them by their stubborn streak.","wo":"Seenug dëgër bopp moo leen jàppale ci seen pas-pas.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSéne deugeur bopp mo léne diapalé si séne pas pas.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":64,"row":{"en":"When we work with this mindset, we can find meaning and purpose in even the most mundane tasks.","wo":"Sunuy demee xel moomu, danuy gis njariñ ba ci liggéey yi gëna ñàkk solo.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSougnouy démé khél momou daniouy guiss ndiarigne ba thi liguey yi gueuna niak solo.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":65,"row":{"en":"You quickly dispatch three of the slowed humanoids with your bolts, their clumsy movements offering little sport.","wo":"Dengay dindi ci lu gaaw ñett ci humanoid yu yeex yi ak say boulong, seeni doxin yu jeng joxewuñu ludul tuuti ci njeriñ.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDangay dindi si lou gaaw gnett si humanoide you yeukh yi ak say boulon, séni dokhine you djiang diokhewougnou loudoul touti si ndierigne.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":66,"row":{"en":"Computers were large, expensive machines that were used for scientific and military purposes.","wo":"Ordinatër yi masin yu rëy lañu woon ba noppi seen njëg jafe lool, gëstukat yi ak soldaar yi ñoo ko daan jëfandikoo.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nOrdinateur yi massine you reuy lagnou wone ba noppi seen ndieuk diafé loool, guestoukat yi ak soldat yi gno ko dane dieufandiko.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":67,"row":{"en":"I stood before the sculpture, my heart filled with both awe and sadness.","wo":"Ma taxaw ci kanamu yatteef gi, sama xol diis ànd ak naqar.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMa takhaw thi kanamou yattef dji sama khol diss and ak nakhar.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":68,"row":{"en":"The veteran smiled. It's nice to meet you, Sarah, he said.","wo":"Soldaar ba woon muuñ niko, kontaan naa ci xam la Sarah.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSoldat ba wone mougne niko contane na si khamla Sarah\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":69,"row":{"en":"He ran a dairy herd, kept sheep, and grew potatoes, cereals, and wheat-straw for thatching.","wo":"Dafay yor géttu bu muy rattee soow, di yar ay baayima, di bay pomme de terre ak dugub ak ñaxum blé ngir ngooñ.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDafay yorr guéttou boumouy raté soow, di yar ay bayima, di bay pomme de terre ak dougoube ak gnakhoum blé nguir ngogn.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":70,"row":{"en":"She was worthy of love, and she deserved to be happy.","wo":"Yelloo na ñu bëgg ko, yelloo na itam am xol bu féex.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nYelloo nagnou beugue ko, yelloo na itame ame khol bou fekhé.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":71,"row":{"en":"Imagine a small town in South Carolina where everyone knows everyone else.","wo":"Xalaatal benn dëkk bu ndaw ci Caroline du Sud, muy dëkk bu ñépp xamante.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKhalatal bene deuk bou ndaw si caroline du sud