di dougue si sa yaram, nga may say sidite gnou bayéko.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":78,"row":{"en":"My uncle was so relieved that he had escaped, but he was also covered in manure.","wo":"Sama ndijaar féex na ndax limu rëcci jaan ji, waaye yaram wi yépp neefere la.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSama ndiar fékh na ndakh limou reuthie diane dji wayé yaram wi yeup neferé la.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":79,"row":{"en":"They offer several features such as fire, carbon monoxide, and fall monitoring.","wo":"Deesna am ci ñom ay anam yu bëri yu melni wottu safara, monoxyde de carbon ak di wottu njëll yi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDeyssane am ci gnom ay anam you beuri you melni wottou safara, monoxyde de carbone ak di wottou ndieul yi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":80,"row":{"en":"Moreover, after each session, the inner space becomes vaster and bigger.","wo":"Rax ci dolli, ginaaw sesioŋ bu nekk bayaali biir yi dañuy gëna yaatu, gëna rëy.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nRakh si dolli ginaw session bou nekk bayali biir yi daniouy geuna yaatou geuna reuy.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":81,"row":{"en":"It was a woman's voice, soft and gentle.","wo":"Baatu jigéen la woon, woyof ba noppi teey.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBaatou djiguéne la wone, woyof ba nopi téyé.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":82,"row":{"en":"I stop the car and get out.","wo":"Maa gaare oto bi daal di génn.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMagaré auto bi daldi guénne.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":83,"row":{"en":"So if you are not content on keen maintenance, the 2-stroke engine may work for you.","wo":"Sudee bëggoo ñu defal la maintenance bu xóot, xool motër bi ci 2 fànn dina baax ci yaw.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSudé beugoo gnou défal la maintenance bou khoot khol moteur bi si 2 fane dina bakh si yaw.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":84,"row":{"en":"He knew that smoking was bad for his health, but he couldn't seem to quit.","wo":"Xamoon na bu baax ni tóx baaxul, waaye nuruwul ku bëgga bàyyi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKhamone na bou bakh ni toh bahoul wayé nurouwoul kou beuga bayi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":85,"row":{"en":"It also helps to ensure that all voices are heard, and that the public is informed about important issues.","wo":"Dina may itam ku nekk mu mëna fësal kàddoom, te lépp lu xew askan wi daf ko wara yëg.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDina may itam kou nek mou meuna feussal kadom té lep lou heuw askane wi dafko wara yeug.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":86,"row":{"en":"He smoked a pack of cigarettes a day, and he had been doing so for over 20 years.","wo":"Bis bu nekk dina tóx benn paketu sigaret, mu koy def lu weesu 20 at.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBiss bou nek dina toh bene pakétou sigaré, mou koy def lou wésou 20 att.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":87,"row":{"en":"Book artist, printmaker, rabid reader, freelance writer, and editor.","wo":"Artistu téere, gravër, jàngkat yu xër, bindkat ak editër yuy demal seen bopp.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nArtisteu téré, graveur, diangate you kheur, bindkate ak éditeur youy démal sen bopp.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":88,"row":{"en":"It was one of the largest and most fearsome predators to ever walk the Earth.","wo":"Nekkoon na benn ci rëbbkat yi gëna mag, gëna raglu bu musa dox ci kaw suuf.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nNekone na bene si reubeukat yi geuna mag, geuna raglou bou meusseu dokh si kaw souf.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":89,"row":{"en":"One of my favorite animals that we ever kept was a rabbit named Cocoa.","wo":"Benn ci baayima yiñ daan yar bu ma gëna neex mooy benn lëk bu tuddu Cocoa.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBenn thi bayima yign dane yar bouma geuna nekh moy benn leuk bou toudou cocoa\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":90,"row":{"en":"When you're ready to return to the present, take a few deep breaths and open your eyes.","wo":"Soo noppee ngir yewwu, noyyil bu baax ab diir soo noppee nga ubbi say bët.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSo nopé nguir yéwou noyyil bou bakh ab diir so nopé nga oubbi say beut.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":91,"row":{"en":"Man: We are not here to cause violence.","wo":"Man: Nun yee fitna taxu nu fi ñëw.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMane: Gnoune yé fitna takhou gnou fi nieuw.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":92,"row":{"en":"I sit on the edge of the bed, my feet dangling over the side.","wo":"Ma toog ci catu lal bi samay tànk di laŋ ci wet gi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMa togue thi sathou lal bi samay tank di lane thi wet gui.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":93,"row":{"en":"Thus the London exhibition will complement and augment this splendid array.","wo":"Kon exposé bu Londres bi dina delloo njukkal ak sargal liggéey bu rafet bii.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKon exposé bou Londres bi dina dello njoukal ak sargal liguey bou rafet bii.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":94,"row":{"en":"A young woman is searching for food in a dumpster.","wo":"Benn xale bu góor a ngi wër lumu lekk cib beenu mbalit.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBenn khalé bou goor a ngui weur loumou lekk thi beenou mbalite.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":95,"row":{"en":"The year is 1920, and the place is New York City.","wo":"Ñoo ngi ci atum 1920, te barab bi mooy New York City.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nGno ngui thi atoum 1920 té barab bi moy new york city.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":96,"row":{"en":"Tap to mine diamonds and dig gold, hunt rare prey, chop trees and craft epic gear.","wo":"Bësal ngir wut diamand ak ngir gas wuru